-level CRUD operations (create, read, update, delete), use layout tools, and see the canvas via screenshots[6][7][8].\n*   **Integration with Antigravity:** Users configure the MCP server in their Antigravity settings to give the IDE's agent access to the Excalidraw toolkit[3][5]. This enables a seamless workflow where the agent can create and refine diagrams without leaving the development environment[3][8].\n*   **Functionality:** It includes a canvas server (web UI) and an MCP server that exposes 26+ tools for programmatic control over the Excalidraw canvas[1][6][9].\n*   **Documentation:** You can find the repository at [github.com/yctimlin/mcp_excalidraw](https://github.com/yctimlin/mcp_excalidraw)[1]. It is widely documented in articles discussing AI-first engineering workflows using tools like Antigravity, Claude Code, and Cursor[3][6][10].\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFcDd0fy30MjdkH43GUzQm0CUKWLt9dN7JN-EgQEUWAmNFvYQ_U7eG2TSnV5P1cR1uNR8EhBJhygdwTrCxxeNE8Us2rxx1wYzBoDvMskiuOwOtHtAAWNTiUCLsmdJb3Ng==)\n[\n<truncated 205 bytes>\nsmdJb3Ng==)\n[3] [medium.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG5juKY7J4816KFCzHHJc6JUyleYAg-_kQxX_xAeEUOHeHY0Rt-rs8tZvewzVubmcI5VKWJ3i5gVq4or8ZICzbEDfY18Z1GJ6qFAj-QAa1UCd8GGEKVzt2uROPpLg5KTQHmUMuQnDN8DAj-V_CqC3ScvfuK4ZCRTLJ9tcn3cSsidsw5zlION892IG5m1ExYdCG3TglDpPadD_fnKWhc-w0ZNWY=)\n[4] [nimbalyst.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQExBuSkeh7hGyId3UYMX2HG4BtaJO3L_h1ZdPOdlhVL1YUrk57r4fFhYH8vKxRQaXoOzk_CqsCi_JgVlcgxTFanbglytZLUv_wNTS5MSUhDLA==)\n[5] [dev.to](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHYn6uHQjXpWM1DTW3R4pqdRejSVl0lqbr2EmA33Py1epSpbYqqhlALTT4F76yr9bkIpRnsS-8UY4chUkAQW7Ys8g6HPmEE8oAa48QgtjFeHt6DKLQFIf47iTtqZUHH4dEebIJu_LHcrmLJUeFqJXF9scgZxORHPFAb34L_HB4_GuJrWK2elNId9-wD3yjlJZhEOu22gEMcFICWG93r8uyM7IaL4pZkEg==)\n[6] [npmjs.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.goog