{"step_index":101,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T14:15:16Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-22T18:15:16+04:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-22T18:15:20+04:00\nThe search for \"\"mcp-excalidraw-server\" \"Claude Desktop\"\" returned the following summary:\n`mcp-excalidraw-server` is an **MCP (Model Context Protocol) server** designed to integrate Excalidraw's diagramming capabilities directly into AI agents, such as those running in **Claude Desktop**, Cursor, or other MCP-compatible clients[1][2][3].\n\n### What it does\nUnlike basic integrations that might only generate a static image, `mcp-excalidraw-server` provides a **persistent, interactive workbench** for AI agents[4][5][6]. It allows Claude to[1][6]:\n*   **Create and Modify:** Programmatically create, edit, update, or delete elements on an Excalidraw canvas[3][5].\n*   **Persistent Workflow:** Maintains the canvas state, allowing for iterative refinement of diagrams rather than one-off generations[7][6].\n*   **Advanced Control:** Offers tools for layout management, element-level control, screenshotting (so the AI can \"see\" what it has drawn), and file export[1][3][5].\n\n### How to use it with Claude Desktop\nTo use it with Claude Desktop, you typically configure the server in your `claude_desktop_config.json` file[8][9].\n\n1.  **Configuration:** You add the server to your configuration file, pointing to the local installation of the MCP server[8][9]. A typical configuration entry looks like this:\n    ```json\n    \"mcpServers\": {\n      \"excalidraw\": {\n        \"command\": \"node\",\n        \"args\": [\"/absolute/path/to/your/excalidraw-mcp/dist/index.js\"]\n      }\n    }\n    ```\n2.  **Usage:** Once configured and Claude Desktop is restarted, Claude will have access to the Excalidraw tools[9][10]. You can then prompt Claude in natural language to \"create an architecture diagram,\" \"visualize this code,\" or \"draw a flowchart,\" and it will use the MCP tools to interact with the canvas[2][11][10].\n\n### Important Distinction\nThere are different versions of Excalidraw MCP servers available:\n*   **`mcp-excalidraw-server` (e.g., by yctimlin):** This is the version oft\n<truncated 1732 bytes>\n2dfIc0N7pvb2QEVOjNqMDZEV3Nf8Rgm7nIOOiQ=)\n[6] [mcp.so](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGI7A8PAYcbvfm7GCh0xBAa3-DLn0dIPNNNyw2W6hOD1AUflsSsQaC1a_Cy02a4pWC1e3XayahJngaZfkTsS6_YCSCYY0szXj3bujEjvZgThrKmZao0M5h5Qsai)\n[7] [hysenlabs.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHnV8KOz9lalV3DUvJXiXyD9u5G_4PnY7CHC1KBOzfZvPxQjCye9BQDLOK3IjPptw6oUuCpqsRmuBhcc-weh6DQTwT_ufi254goWLRgsjlAbWh81FJUB-vOvmWLkeLPWpmtww0-oB5d7E0G0QndnDc=)\n[8] [lobehub.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGUv9ViManHUHQpVwYqbq7ZWsJ51tLmIJ_VA40oRC-rN96a2zr8Ktn0I_YnpBI4hsxjWaQKVXHTu_Mqjk7zhAicWSKR7gyRlU9gBnyxtzN42258JdSxKshfA-dZ1SCZDNAl3wAtw2A9Gh_mAg==)\n[9] [skywork.ai](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFEaonIbETLEPUSJaZs1taCXoNTEIaQA-kb4QUqz4-OmeixcWmzIiPYcX_nwVXAuc5I112nWnbwXMSwSN6yKD_hFtX5UKW8O3MA1HL6-sRUpyGu9zb--HnfU4DwmL7NLbweUvb0jy3mH5ceJW2bwVEO8gP4dSbAjAeRRJINihUzdPik9K5TK6mn3g==)\n[10] [rajeevpentyala.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFsNazd5-3F6q72fzjbI8pxebwe1Z65oUUNTXINraQEQsDYosjAxCwsC_pWMgkzBDxan1cXsUwAnlJWk4czdXhR468wJ5Y1anHrsXvhwtTuELtw0E5MdFHkPri54dgIn7BKIczuAXn0Otaic5LYFuRgvJuF5S-D-cEnA1p7SfXGZ12EvUSq-auFLzJ8T3i4QjvmCBGYcmvt3g==)\n[11] [wordpress.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFZPFoc27cerQgLsXwF1W-zRZuLfWKTNJyZ-WjkNXyHnyIuuDlCf1BU--MWUbInYYBDnViwmkqp_l-1A9t73cOWm_fK-2A_Gl6h_ra7U8q7lSJiTjbEv61Z7aea2oX8fnr8HdsTPQOcxzfHFqYdVWKDghug9XCl34ly3U6izvW0fXOhD2Fs0zIl9eUSnkngkYbhGFrv8Glvo_8j0TZrUYLdKgbcZg==)\n[12] [excalidraw.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFndeYBoLGuGAwAJXMwnrS_gO6ER_zZ0SvyIhVCVsUkpsv1